      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c1475afb7ce126e9e0e3a39|full_name}: Yes! The simple solution is:\nAdd some checkbox like [Enable Lip sync] [Enable Eyetracking] [Enable Blink] On VRC_Avatardiscripter component, and user trigger it from animation override.",
