  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-04T04:59:31.770Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I hope that the automatic blink currently being done in VRChat (which takes place using the top four shape keys in the \"Body\" mesh object) will be disabled during an animation override using a hand sign.\n\nThis is due to the following reasons:\n There are many avatars (especially in Japan) that change expressions in the animation overrides assigned to the hand signs. Currently, there is no way to disable the automatic blink, so if the blink animation is performed while changing the expression, the expression will break. That would be awful.\nMany avatars disable automatic blink by dumming four specific shape keys.\nMany people should be able to benefit from both if automatic blinks and animation overrides do not interfere.",
